      - title: Menu Text
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: "Long an' lovely. Jus' me an' the wine \u2014 the way it oughta be.
          I looove wine, friend\u2026 the smell, the swirl, the taste, the little
          stains it leaves on the tablecloth. An' oh \u2014 hic \u2014 that color.
          Deep an' dark, like a sunset drownin' at the bottom o' the glass. Prettiest
          thing I ever \u2014 hup \u2014 saw. My two big brothers? They never let
          me near the good bottles. 'Yer too young,' they'd grumble, 'go play.' Pffft.
          Look at me now \u2014 more vintages than birthdays, an' I ain't racked
          up many o' those yet."
        type: 0
        typeString: 
