      - title: Menu Text
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: "My color? Man, I only throw down on one surface \u2014 fresh-cut
          grass, out in the open field. Springy, alive, smells like summer\u2026
          an' that color? Cool an' bright, like a four-leaf clover that actually
          means it. That's my whole vibe. See, big bro won't dance \u2014 too stiff,
          too old. An' the little one can't even stand up, always sloshed. Me, I'm
          right in between 'em, holdin' the beat. Now back up \u2014 I got a headspin
          callin' my name."
        type: 0
        typeString: 
